DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nFrom Insights to Action: How might we build a resilie
	nt career in banking?\nSynopsis\n:\nJoin us in this session where Soumee D
	e\, Partner from EY Workforce Advisory will share insights on the followin
	g topics: \n*	Explore Megatrends impacting the workforce in banking sector
	 / financial industry \n*	Case stories on workforce transformation initiat
	ives adapting to these Megatrends \n*	EY’s story on building a skills-le
	d learning organisation \n*	What can we do now\, next and beyond?\nSpeaker
	\n:\nSoumee DE\, Partner\, People Advisory Services EY Singapore\nJoining 
	Instructions\n(via Webex)\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participan
	t using DBS laptop\, you must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS 
	Laptop.mp4 <https://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_d
	bs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide pri
	or to the event. This will install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Cen
	tre for optimal streaming experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click 
	on this hyperlink: Webex Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.p
	hp?MTID=e7716564ccfe56b67dbb7054a6f359fb0> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, La
	st Name\, Email Address and click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Dev
	ice\n1.	Download Webex Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlaySto
	re\nClick on Join Meeting & Input Meeting Number: 2510 686 5933\n2.	Input 
	Password 1234\n \n \nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Si
	ngapore)\nDial:  +852-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (Indi
	a-Mumbai)\nDial:  +91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  251
	0 686 5933\nGlobal call-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin
	.php?MTID=e8b348588cbf111d8933d1b2e9c4a554e> \n \n \n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230720T105000
